    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vocator</strong> combines the unpredictability of a roguelike, the strategic planning of a board game, and the tactical depth of an autobattler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>8 unique Vocators</strong>, each with a powerful ability that shapes your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play from a roster of <strong>70 heroes</strong>, placing them on the board to boost your army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reroll your servants' dice</strong> to land them on tiles occupied by  heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and equip <strong>86 artifacts</strong> that enhance heroes, empower servants, or alter core game rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover powerful synergies</strong> between heroes, artifacts, servants, and abilities to maximize your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the <strong>roguelike gameplay loop</strong>, uncovering new strategies and combinations with each run to overcome increasing challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a roguelike enthusiast, a fan of tactical autobattlers, or someone who loves strategic board games, <i>Vocator</i> challenges you to think ahead, adapt fast, and master the mechanics.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vocator</strong> combines the unpredictability of a roguelike, the strategic planning of a board game, and the tactical depth of an autobattler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>8 unique Vocators</strong>, each with a powerful ability that shapes your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play from a roster of <strong>70 heroes</strong>, placing them on the board to boost your army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reroll your servants' dice</strong> to land them on tiles occupied by  heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and equip <strong>86 artifacts</strong> that enhance heroes, empower servants, or alter core game rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover powerful synergies</strong> between heroes, artifacts, servants, and abilities to maximize your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the <strong>roguelike gameplay loop</strong>, uncovering new strategies and combinations with each run to overcome increasing challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a roguelike enthusiast, a fan of tactical autobattlers, or someone who loves strategic board games, <i>Vocator</i> challenges you to think ahead, adapt fast, and master the mechanics.</p>",
    "short_description": "Vocator is a strategic roguelike that blends Monopoly-inspired board mechanics with autobattler gameplay. Place heroes on the board, empower your servants, and adapt your strategy to survive.",
